        "label:n4->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "On the other hand, if an exception is not needed, the process can continue."
      ],
      "justification": "Negative guard, continuation action, and edge label accurately model the alternative path and its progression."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
